{%- comment -%}
  Purelane boot — rendered once from layout/theme.liquid, inside <head>.

  Marks the document as JS-capable before first paint. Every Purelane
  scroll-reveal hides itself behind `.pl-js`, so if scripts are blocked or
  fail the content renders in its final state instead of staying at opacity 0
  forever (which is what the prototype did).
{%- endcomment -%}
<script>document.documentElement.classList.add('pl-js');</script>
